    "title": "Aggregated apiserver fixture",
    "description": "Models an aggregation-layer OpenAPI document: schema keys are short names and no schema carries the group-version-kind extension, so a page has to declare the group, version and kind itself. GvklessView is routed without a status subresource; StatusfulView is routed with one. Both schemas carry a status property, which is state rather than an interface and therefore does not decide whether the subresource route exists.",
